    oe:aboutDisease oed:cirrhosis ;
    oe:answerText "There is uncertainty regarding the hepatic efficacy of glucagon-like peptide-1 receptor agonists (GLP-1RAs) in metabolic dysfunction-associated steatotic liver disease (MASLD) or steatohepatitis (MASH). We performed a meta-analysis of randomised controlled trials (RCTs) to examine the efficacy of GLP-1RAs in treating MASLD or MASH."^^xsd:string ;
